.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH milestone 1  "milestone " 
.SH NAME
milestone \- Work with repository milestones
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmilestone\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with repository milestones
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
milestone\-list(1)
List milestones
.TP
milestone\-create(1)
Create a milestone
.TP
milestone\-edit(1)
Edit a milestone identified by its current title
.TP
milestone\-delete(1)
Delete a milestone (asks for confirmation unless \-\-yes)
.TP
milestone\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
